OL,3,GNEWSANine arrested in immigration raids
OL,4,Aon Scottish fishing fleet
OL,5,
OL,6,FNine people have been arrested under
OL,7,Fimmigration legislation after fishing
OL,8,Fboats were targeted in Aberdeenshire
OL,9,Fand the Highlands.
OL,11,FThe arrests - four in Mallaig and five
OL,12,Fin Fraserburgh - were carried out by
OL,13,Fimmigration enforcement officers over a
OL,14,Fweek.
OL,16,FBetween 26 and 30 July, Immigration
OL,17,FEnforcement's Threat Response and
OL,18,FVolume Crime Unit was deployed across
OL,19,Fthe ports of Barra, Oban, Fraserburgh,
OL,20,Fand Mallaig following intelligence
OL,21,Frelating to a suspected rogue fishing
OL,22,Ffleet operator.
OL,23,APub: 03-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,426,420,260,160,0,100
