OL,3,GNEWSANine arrested in immigration raids
OL,4,Aon Scottish fishing fleet
OL,5,
OL,6,FOfficers boarded 34 fishing boats in
OL,7,Fresponse to reports of modern slavery,
OL,8,Flabour exploitation, illegal working,
OL,9,Fand wider criminality within the UK
OL,10,Fcommercial fishing industry.
